 - Observer design pattern is behavioral design pattern that lets define subscription mechanism to notify multiple object aboit any event occurs.
 - Class which notify about event called subject also it publishing event to other classes so it called publisher.
 - And classes which is listing to this class is called subscriber
 - This pattern suggest that we add subscriber to the subject class in reality subject class has 
   1. array field to store subscriber object
   2. Several publish methods which allow to attach or detach subscribers object

 - All subscriber must follow interface and using this interface publiser will communicate with subscriber. it have method interfac with proper parameter that the publisher can pass contextual data to subscriber.

 Example:
 Lets after order place we want to notify to Email, Inventory, Analytics etc